  "pre_registration": "PRE-REGISTERED BEFORE THE BED WAS QUERIED. (a) = number of DISTINCT captured query terms (len > 2, the BM25 shortlist's own filter) that occur in the needle's gold chunk text (genes.content), occurrence decided by FTS5 phrase match under the same default unicode61 tokenizer genes_fts uses. A needle is a TRUE VOCABULARY GAP iff (a) == 0; it is OUTRANKED iff (a) > 0. No third bucket, no tunable threshold.",
