    "genes_fts_ddl": "CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE genes_fts USING fts5(\n    gene_id,\n    content,\n    complement,\n    content='genes_fts_source',\n    content_rowid='rowid'\n)",
    "resolved": "unicode61 (FTS5 default; no tokenize= clause)",
    "note": "genes_fts DDL carries no tokenize= clause -> SQLite FTS5 DEFAULT tokenizer 'unicode61' (remove_diacritics=1, Unicode L*/N* token characters, case-folded). Matching is delegated to an in-memory FTS5 table built with the same default tokenizer, so no re-implementation is involved."
